# "As long as AN opponent has 10 or less life": in a three-player game Bot3, the later seat, is taken from 20 to exactly 10
# by two Lightning Bolts and a Fireblast on turn 4 while Bot2 stays at 20. One opponent at the line is enough: the
# Bloodghast cast afterwards has haste and attacks Bot2 for 2 the turn it is cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Fireblast
Mountain
Island
Bloodghast
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot3)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot3)
Bot1.Hand.Fireblast.Cast(Bot3; Ability: Sacrifice)
Bot1.Choose(Mountain; Mountain)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Bloodghast.Cast
? Bot3.Life = 10
? Bot2.Life = 20
[T4 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Bloodghast > Bot2)
[T4 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot3.Life = 10
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Battlefield.Bloodghast.Keywords = CantBlock; Haste
